# House Price Data Analysis

## 1. Overview
This project analyzes house prices using Python.

## 2. Dataset
The dataset is `kc_house_data.csv`.

It contains house prices and property details.

## 3. Objectives
- Analyze house prices.
- Clean the dataset.
- Find missing values.
- Study house features.
- Identify price outliers.

## 4. Data Preprocessing
- Load the dataset.
- Check missing values.
- Remove duplicate records.
- Clean invalid data.
- Convert date columns.

## 5. Data Analysis
- Find average house prices.
- Analyze bedrooms and bathrooms.
- Study house living area.
- Calculate property age.
- Check price outliers.

## 6. Visualization
- Use histograms to show price distribution.
- Use boxplots to identify outliers.
- Display data using charts.

## 7. Tools Used
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Google Colab

## 8. Result
The project helps us understand house prices and property features.

## 9. Future Improvement
We can build a machine learning model to predict house prices.

